OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 6 JAN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThe leading Manchester spiritual
OL,12,     Gjazz trumpeter and label owner
OL,13,     GMatthew Halsall has a new release.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GJeneba Kanneh-Mason is the
OL,16,     Gsoloist in Chopin's second piano
OL,17,     Gconcerto in this concert from
OL,18,     GBudapest, alongside Beethoven's
OL,19,     G'Eroica' Symphony and Kodaly's
OL,20,     GDances from Galanta.
